# API v1

- Errors: `{ code, message }` via `lib/errors.ts` `apiError`.
- Session routes: `requireSession`, `requireActivePlayer`, or `requireAdmin` from `lib/session-guards.ts`.
- Public hook ingest: `POST /api/v1/hooks/[token]/events` — token auth only; reject inactive non-admins.
- Keep `openapi/openapi.yaml` aligned with status codes and bodies.
- Live gifts: publish through `lib/live.ts` (in-memory SSE). Do not invent a second bus.
- Gift processing helpers: `lib/hooks.ts` (parse, streak skip, fingerprint, bindings).
